      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T18:17:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t agree that LogCrit is sufficient here. A negative fsal_fd_total_counter violates the FD accounting invariant:\n\ntotal \u003d global + state + temp\n\nThe abort is intentional because it captures a core dump and preserves the state needed to diagnose and backtrack the accounting corruption. LogCrit would only report the error and allow execution to continue with an invalid counter, which could make the original issue harder to diagnose.",
